Enter a state of heightened focus for [4, 5, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns. While in this state your ranged attack speed is increased by [11%, 20%, 25%, 28%, 30% (TL1-5)], your shots do not consume ammo, and all shots capable of marking have their chance to mark increased by [21%, 32%, 39%, 45%, 49% (TL1-5)].
